WEBVTT

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:38.330
Listen up. I have a dream...

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.590
One day, all of this world's wealth

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:43.330
Stage 35

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.330
Golden Mines

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:46.660
will belong to us, the Gold Hunters.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:51.750
Stop trying to sound cool 
while you're fondling someone's ass!

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.220
You huge perv!

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.660
Stop trying to act like the leader.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:02.880
My huge dream...

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:08.360
Suigin Learns to Play the Grave Robbing Game!

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:10.640
That's not you...

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.390
It's me!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.300
Aomori

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.190
My wound...

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.400
<i>You're Riku Suigin, aren't you?</i>

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.580
<i>Yes... Who are you?</i>

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.140
My name is Temujin.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:05.370
Totems' Hideout

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.160
Temujin of Totems.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.370
Cross Fortress

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:09.310
I'll be waiting for you in 
<i>Grave Buster</i>, Suigin.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.280
W-Wait. Hey! Hello?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.370
Temujin...

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.640
Incoming

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.330
R-Riku Rei!

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.130
Yeah! I'm gonna do this!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.440
You ended up paying 200,000?!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.440
If you obtain the Divine Coins,

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:45.060
200,000 can turn into a hundred 
or even two hundred times more.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:48.620
I might be interested in you.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.980
You wanna join me?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.070
I do!

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:56.540
What? 500,000?! I'll pay 500,000!

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:59.360
I might be interested in you instead.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.050
Our prey doesn't seem to be coming out.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:11.000
I'm not going to get enough exercise 
just dealing with all the small fry.

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:16.420
I joined up with you because you 
talked big, but what's going on?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.610
We're about to catch a huge 
quarry, so calm down.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.150
Hmph.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.380
Well, I hope so.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.300
Hey...

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:28.920
What's wrong?

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.410
How long are we going to keep this up?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.490
Just for now.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:39.550
In this world, money is power.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:46.060
As long as we have money, all the important 
people of Precious will acknowledge us.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:51.090
So let's all enjoy that dream 
together, when the time comes!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.020
Bro, over there!

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.330
Ah, looks like we found us 
some fat little duckies.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.520
All right, let's go...

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.040
you guys...

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.420
We're ready.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:16.210
Y-You know what's up.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:25.780
New members of <i>Grave Buster</i> must 
first do the "beginner registration,"

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:29.230
Shinryou Academy

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.810
and pass the entrance exam.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.230
Library

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.780
All players that officially enter...

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.060
Read something a hundred times,

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.360
and the meaning will become clear.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.070
You seem hard at work, Suigin.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:39.950
Ranshou.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.070
So you were reading up on <i>Grave Buster</i>?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.070
Well, you're in luck!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.420
I'm in luck?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.780
Despite her looks, she's a game freak,

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.670
and she participated in the closed beta.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.870
N-Nice to meet you...

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.340
This cuts pretty well.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.500
Looks like the 200,000 paid off.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.550
You're amazing!

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.960
Money is power! Survival of the fittest!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.200
My, aren't you strong?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:21.600
Well, yeah.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.520
How noble.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:27.410
Seeing how strong you are, 
I have a favor to ask you...

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.960
Just name it!

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:33.240
Hey, wait! Don't you think 
she seems suspicious?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:38.760
We found a really amazing treasure,

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:42.320
but there are a lot of 
scary monsters inside,

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.640
and I'm so scared that I'm 
going to get attacked.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.910
This lady...

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.380
...being attacked by monsters...

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.980
No!

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.660
Come on, you should ask for 
their help, too, Farin-chan.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.940
P-Please...

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.960
She's a cutie, too!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.560
Her slightly cold demeanor is great!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.120
Well, let's go.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:05.950
Yeah!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.870
H-Hey, you guys!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.750
Wait!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.670
Currently, the ruler of <i>Grave Buster</i>

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:17.700
is a person named Dark Tiger, who is the 
head of an organization known as Precious.

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.610
Precious has an enormous amount of wealth,

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:27.880
and uses it to control the game world while stealing
 other players' money and items to gain more power.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:35.090
But lately, there have been forces 
fighting against them...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.230
Temujin of Totems?

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.010
You're getting into something 
pretty dangerous.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:46.690
Totems is a new force 
fighting against Precious.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:51.210
Temujin is their leader, and is a villain 
who is willing to do anything.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:55.310
He's known as the terrifying 
man who devours everything.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.180
Devours everything?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:07.890
The man who devours everything...

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.110
The man who devours...

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.180
Riku Rei!

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:33.820
I'm coming in.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.100
Well, are you comfortable?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.110
Make yourself at home.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:46.250
If there's something you need, 
I'll make sure you get it.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.380
Let me go!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.530
Sorry, but that's out of the question.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.110
Soon...

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:07.900
You'll never want to leave this place.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.080
Well, aren't you a feisty one?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.700
That's fine.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.110
It wouldn't be any fun if you weren't.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.090
Te

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:28.420
Temujin

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.320
It's around here.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.780
Here?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.080
It doesn't look like anything's here.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.700
Maybe they all ran off after 
they saw our equipment.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.160
Yeah, totally!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:58.570
Aw, but we were just 
slimed and got all sticky

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:03.160
because of some monsters 
in that abandoned mine.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.430
Come on. Like that'd...

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:11.710
And they took three million 
from us when it happened.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.710
Th-Three million?!

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.960
Three million!

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:31.420
Wait, what is this?

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.830
What is this?

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:35.900
Onee-san!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.020
Little loli girl!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:39.330
We're trapped in here!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.220
Save us!

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:46.130
You idiots! Can't you see 
that we got played?!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.930
N-No way!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.100
Let us out! Please!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.010
I'm going to report you guys!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.620
Good grief.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.620
That's...

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:00.520
B-Bro!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.780
The heavens call! The earth calls!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:11.320
The people call! They call 
me to make the money!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:14.660
The man who lives and dies for money!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:17.660
They call me the Golden Ryouzaburou.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.310
They also call me...

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.800
Wild Wolf!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.930
That's me!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Stands Once Again!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.810
The Silver Guardian!
